# Built-ins are ordinary shadowable bindings, so this assignment is legal —
# but the call must say what happened (§8.2). Four built-ins are nouns, and
# the consequence of assigning to one lands at the next call, on another
# line, as a complaint about a type.
# expect: 5
# expect-error: AH3013 at 9:4
ርዝመት = 5
ጻፍ(ርዝመት)
ጻፍ(ርዝመት("ሰላም"))
